ance":1,"parent_person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABA","source_assertion_id":"a-liang021-wangfen-family-qian-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-021","source_id":"s-liangshu-021-wangfen-ws1544250","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangfen","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p012","quote":"僉字公會，錫第五弟也。八歲丁父憂，哀毀過禮。服闋，召補國子生，祭酒袁昂稱爲通理。策高第，除長史兼秘書郎中，歷尚書殿中郎，太子中舍人，與吳郡陸襄對掌東宮管記。出爲建安太守。山酋方善、謝稀聚徒依險，屢爲民患，僉潛設方略，率衆平之，有詔褒美，頒示州郡。除武威將軍、始興內史，丁所生母憂，固辭不拜。又除寧遠將軍、南康內史，屬盧循作亂，復轉僉爲安成內史，以鎮撫之。還除黃門侍郎，尋爲安西武陵王長史、蜀郡太守。僉憚岨嶮，固以疾辭，因以黜免。久之，除戎昭將軍、尚書左丞，復補黃門侍郎，遷太子中庶子，掌東宮管記。太清二年十二月，卒，時年四十五。贈侍中，給東園秘器，朝服一具，衣一襲。承聖三年，世祖追詔曰：「賢而不伐曰恭，諡恭子。」","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p012:m0000","object_person_reference_id":"c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p012:r0014"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"弟傳首承錫，第76行明載錫為王琳第二子，第83行明稱其弟八歲丁父憂。","human_reviewed":false}},{"id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAFA","label":"王氏（梁敬帝皇后、王僉女）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"敬王皇后","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-012-jing-consorts:p002:m0000"]},{"surface":"王氏","mention_ids":["c-liangshu-006-jing-consorts:p002:m0016"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-012","source_id":"s-nanshi-012-jing-consorts-ws2060595","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-012-jing-consorts","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-012-jing-consorts:p002","quote":"敬王皇后","mention_id":"c-nanshi-012-jing-consorts:p002:m0000"},{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-006","source_id":"s-liangshu-006-jing-consorts-ws2311629","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-006-jing-consorts","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-006-jing-consorts:p002","quote":"王氏","mention_id":"c-liangshu-006-jing-consorts:p002:m0016"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"南史原句父僉自有傳，未載本名。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAF","source_assertion_id":"a-nan012-jing-consorts-m-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-012","source_id":"s-nanshi-012-jing-consorts-ws2060595","c